Build incrementally:

Phase 1 — Foundation
- Solution structure
- Clean Architecture projects
- PostgreSQL
- EF Core
- Migrations
- Docker
- Configuration
- Logging

Phase 2 — Identity
- Register
- Login
- JWT
- Refresh token
- Roles/policies

Phase 3 — Restaurant/Menu
- Restaurant
- Branch
- Menu
- Menu item
- Search/filter

Phase 4 — Cart
- Cart
- Cart items
- Price calculation

Phase 5 — Order
- Create order
- Order aggregate
- Status transitions
- Cancellation
- Order history

Phase 6 — Payment
- Payment abstraction
- Provider integration
- Webhook
- Idempotency

Phase 7 — Delivery
- Driver
- Assignment
- Delivery lifecycle
- Location ingestion

Phase 8 — Real-time
- SignalR
- Order status events
- Driver tracking

Phase 9 — Redis / Background Jobs
- Cache
- location state
- queue
- notifications
- retries

Phase 10 — Frontends
- Next.js customer/admin web
